{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"tl-v1","tool":"ragflow_retrieval","arguments":{"dataset_ids":["b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37"],"question":"Go SIG OTelConf RC support PR blocking next release decision","page_size":10,"vector_similarity_weight":0.3,"similarity_threshold":0.2,"top_k":1024,"keyword":false},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"chunks\": [{\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-07]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-26\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-26T14:02:28Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-26T16:36:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-20  \\n\\n## Attendees\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn  \\n\\n- Owen Williams  \\n\\n- Sam Xie\\n\\n- Alex Boten  \\n\\n- David Ashpole  \\n\\n- Bryan Boreham  \\n\\n- (Mentioned: Robert Pająk)\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-07]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-26\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-26T14:02:28Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-26T16:36:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-20  \\n\\n## Discussions\\n\\n### 1. Next Go release & OTelConf RC support\\n\\n- Release blocked on RC support module; PR needs reviews.\\n\\n- Requested changes from Alex do not need to be in the current PR.\\n\\n- Module is `0.x`; breaking changes acceptable later.\\n\\n- Avoid exposing public API known to be removed immediately.\\n\\n- Discussed handling experimental features:\\n\\n  - `WithExperimentalFeatures`-style flag likely unhelpful.\\n\\n  - Possible `x` submodule to clearly isolate experimental APIs.\\n\\n  - Aligns with OTel-wide push for opt-in experimental features.\\n\\n### 2. HTTP default client deprecation (OTel HTTP)\\n\\n- Work deprecating default HTTP client usage is in progress.\\n\\n- `POST`/`GET` helpers rely on `http.DefaultClient` and limit configurability.\\n\\n- Follow-up PRs exist; need review for inclusion in upcoming release.\\n\\n### 3. Observability work & non-blocking PRs\\n\\n- Several observability PRs (e.g., self-observability for OTel gRPC) are ongoing, not release-blocking.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src note 07 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 26 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3581463689 author pellar creat 2025 11 26t14 02 28z updat 2025 11 26t16 36 01z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 20 attende tyler yahn owen william sam xie alex boten david ashpol bryan boreham mention robert paj ą k sourc id src note 07 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 26 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3581463689 author pellar creat 2025 11 26t14 02 28z updat 2025 11 26t16 36 01z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 20 discuss 1 next go releas otelconf rc support releas block on rc support modul pr need review request chang from alex do not need to be in the current pr modul is 0 x break chang accept later avoid expos public api known to be remov immedi discuss handl experiment featur withexperimentalfeatur style flag like unhelp possibl x submodul to clear isol experiment api align with otel wide push for opt in experiment featur 2 http default client deprec otel http work deprec default http client usag is in progress post get helper reli on http defaultcli and limit configur follow up pr exist need review for inclus in upcom releas 3 observ work non block pr sever observ pr e g self observ for otel grpc are ongo not releas block\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"0740d1ea8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"id\": \"c5a65f87687b3520\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.345552239355325, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.15563361336474998, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7886957, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"0740d1ea8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 3959, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:18\", \"token_count\": 1379, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Two non-observability items noted:\\n\\n  - Sync map / atomics for fixed bucket histograms.\\n\\n  - Exemplar reservoir changes.\\n\\n- Safe to slip to next release; include if ready.\\n\\n### 4. Stabilizing new attribute value types\\n\\n- Discussion about stabilizing new spec attribute types (byte arrays, “any” type).\\n\\n- Prototype implementation exists and needs review.\\n\\n- Considered tricky; careful review needed around limits and types.\\n\\n### 5. Processor `Enabled` method\\n\\n- Proposal from Robert to move `Enabled` from filter processor to main processor interface.\\n\\n- Spec now stabilized and allows this.\\n\\n- Pros: consistent API, less ad-hoc type assertion/boilerplate in docs.\\n\\n- Con: processors that are “always enabled” need a trivial `Enabled() bool { return true }`.\\n\\n- General agreement; will revisit for final confirmation.\\n\\n### 6. OTLP `insecure` support (logs, env vars, spec)\\n\\n- PR adds `insecure` (env var) support for OTLP **logs**, matching traces/metrics.\\n\\n- HTTP OTLP config historically messy; env vars common in practice.\\n\\n- Spec unclear due to moratorium on env vars.\\n\\n- Direction: add logs support in Go; push for spec clarity later.\\n\\n### 7. Collector protobuf changes & PDataGen\\n\\n- Collector removed dependency on Go protobuf types; now uses `pdataGen`.\\n\\n- Large internal rewrite; significant line count reduction.\\n\\n- Benchmarks improved (fewer allocations).\\n\\n- Some cross-language quirks surfaced but manageable.\\n\\n- Go SIG interested in exploring similar approaches; needs more benchmarking.\\n\\n### 8. KubeCon & talks\\n\\n- First SIG meeting since KubeCon.\\n\\n- Members encouraged to share notable talks and videos once available.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-07]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-26\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-26T14:02:28Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-26T16:36:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-20  \\n\\n## Decisions\\n\\n- Merge OTelConf RC support PR as-is (pending normal review).\\n\\n- Track experimental API structure review (e.g., `x` submodule) under the `1.40.0` milestone.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"two non observ item note sync map atom for fix bucket histogram exemplar reservoir chang safe to slip to next releas includ if readi 4 stabil new attribut valu type discuss about stabil new spec attribut type byte array ani type prototyp implement exist and need review consid tricki care review need around limit and type 5 processor enabl method propos from robert to move enabl from filter processor to main processor interfac spec now stabil and allow this pro consist api less ad hoc type assert boilerpl in doc con processor that are alway enabl need a trivial enabl bool return true general agreement will revisit for final confirm 6 otlp insecur support log env var spec pr add insecur env var support for otlp log match trace metric http otlp config histor messi env var common in practic spec u