line default change; no “Help Wanted” needed.\\n\\n- Improved error handling:\\n\\n  - Status: PR was in draft and author became inactive.\\n\\n  - Decision: Remove from milestone; consider pinging the author. Should not block release.\\n\\n- High mutex contention in metric sums:\\n\\n  - Status: Assigned to David; actively being fixed.\\n\\n- Observability packages:\\n\\n  - Status: Multiple PRs open and being reworked.\\n\\n  - Release impact: Not critical for upcoming release; if they block, move them out.\\n\\n  - Activity: Some PRs show movement; Tyler is actively working on one; others have limited updates.\\n\\n- Prometheus exporter: Optimize return times:\\n\\n  - Status: Worth review for those working on observability metrics.\\n\\n  - Context: Already merged for the standard trace exporter.\\n\\n  - Note: Awaiting minimum time requirement (~23 minutes) before completion.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-01]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-10-10\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3389930076  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-10T12:53:12Z · **Updated**: 2025-10-10T12:54:14Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-09-25\\n\\n**Attendees:**\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn.\\n\\n- Bryan Boreham.\\n\\n- David Ashpole (dashpole).\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"status pr exist default tempor aggreg function were not expos propos includ a string base tempor select concern replac function via string selector rais concern next no recent activ like to wait and potenti move out of the mileston optim lock for metric aggreg status work in progress by david await one more test pr befor start lock improv context approach review inform with josh mcdonald thought reason good test pr add concurr safe test for metric aggreg need more review note a test run issu caus confus around time order not a fundament time now issu go 1 25 test time manipul may help if need exp